          },
          "description": "ABC Story Sisters is a story time podcast from three young sisters who bring classic children's literature to life for the littlest of podcast fans. The whole family will enjoy this fun-filled storytelling adventure!  Join sisters Alexa, Bristol and Charlotte, as they share their version of the classic tale, Peter Pan!  Listeners will embark on an audible journey that's filled with adventure and packed full of learning.  Learn more at abcstorysisters.com! ",
